%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a996e19c4d83684a905dbed745d44a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: SOCutscene_Tutorial_MusicFile
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIandCinematic.SOCutscene
  _endBlendSeconds: 1
  _steps:
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ceb3947f01fe6754481fd58faa91da91, type: 3}
    CameraKey: 
    Message: "파일이 열렸네! 제목이...\n'마지막 데모 파일'?"
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey: 
    Message: "노래 제목은... '다시, 처음부터'네."
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0879fd8f8104c724f9a9324d90f9033e, type: 3}
    CameraKey: 
    Message: "마지막 데모라... 이걸 끝으로 음악을 그만두려고 했던 걸까?\n그래서 여기 버려진 건가 보네."
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c2cb645af22543c4282ecf8feaa122cf, type: 3}
    CameraKey: 
    Message: "그래도 주인이 버린 파일은 그냥 두는 게 맞아.\n소각장 물건을 들고 나가면 경보가 울려."
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey: 
    Message: "근데... 직접 들어보니까 꽤 괜찮은 노래 같은데?\n한 번 더 듣고 싶어."
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "가져갈래."
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b765be443fad5a14db1e18d8ef5a285b, type: 3}
    CameraKey: 
    Message: "내 말 안 들었어?!\n들고 나가면 안 된다니까!"
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 518ba6e15e207f943bb0ad6f2fd27afe, type: 3}
    CameraKey: 
    Message: "아, 거봐! 경보 울리잖아!\n빨리 도망쳐! 아래쪽 길이 열렸어!"
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
